# Panes - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**      -- Pane Maximize (A-s A-S-s)
**panes + h**        -- Pane Left (A-left)
**panes + l**        -- Pane Right (A-right)
**panes + up**       -- Pane Above (A-up)
**panes + j**        -- Pane Below (A-down)
**panes + -**        -- Pane H Split (A--)
**panes + \**        -- Pane V Split (A-\)
**panes + w**        -- Pane Close (A-w)
**panes + toggle**   -- Pane Toggle (A-q)
**panes + s**        -- Sidebar (A-s)
**panes + lsft + s** -- Sidebar Right (A-S-s)
**panes + g**        -- Select Files
**panes + m**        -- Main (A-m)
